# ===================== 桌面版（Electron）打包工程 =====================
# 说明：.electron-build/ 内只提交源码与配置，
# 依赖、运行时二进制与打包产物均不入库（体积过大且可再生成）。
.electron-build/node_modules/
.electron-build/dist/
.electron-build/build/
.electron-build/_dl/
.electron-build/runtime/node.exe
.electron-build/runtime/ffmpeg/ffmpeg.exe
.electron-build/runtime/ffmpeg/ffprobe.exe
